# Production build config (loaded by `vite build`, which runs in production mode).
# The consolidated Jawafdehi monolith serving /api/* — the v2 cutover target.
# Without this the SPA falls back to same-origin (jawafdehi.org), which does not
# serve /api. OIDC + Sentry use baked-in production defaults (see oidc.ts /
# sentry.ts), so they are intentionally not repeated here.
VITE_JAWAFDEHI_API_BASE_URL=https://api.jawafdehi.org
